      "cooked": "<p><strong>Nephew</strong>: Alright, I feel a need to invest in my own copy of SotM now</p><p><strong>Me</strong>: Really? What lead to that conclusion?</p><p><strong>Nephew</strong>: Just not having played games in a while and getting a group that plays regularly has made me realize that I <em><strong>appreciated it more than I realized</strong></em>&nbsp;[emphasis mine], and I feel like since I have such a personal connection to this game, I just have to get my own copy</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
